    "abstract": "Parts figure for the fuel metering unit delivery nozzle installation on the higher rated engine, showing the nozzle in both standards, the cowl latch bracket and the mount link.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure shows the delivery nozzle installation on the fuel metering unit of the higher rated engine, with the nozzle, the shroud, the cowl latch bracket and the mount link.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the unit looking inboard with the fan cowl open. Items 10 and 10A are the nozzle standards; the revised nozzle at item 10 is two millimetres shorter and carries the new swirl insert. The relocated cowl latch bracket at item 20 must be fitted with the revised nozzle, because the clearance to the shroud is only substantiated for that pair."
    },
